    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Dooley Group bring to the market this 4 bedroom property in the ever popular estate of Beechwood.\n\nLocated close to the town centre within walking distance of all amenities.\n\nThis B rated 4 bedroom property will benefit from the Green Mortgage with cheaper interest rates.\n\nRecently renovated this turn key proeprty is a must for anyone in the market for either a starter home or a trade up. \n\nAccommodation includes: Entrance Hallway, Large Open plan sitting room, Kitchen/Dining Area and downstairs office/bedroom, 4 double bedrooms main bathroom and shower room with large shed to rear.\n\nViewing of the proeprty is highly recommended and by appointment only through REA Dooley Group on 069-6188.\n\n\nEntrance Hallway - 9'0 (2.74m) x 12'6 (3.81m)\nTiled Floor\n\nSitting Room - 12'0 (3.66m) x 26'1 (7.95m)\nSolid Timber Floor\n\nDining Room - 20'0 (6.1m) x 9'0 (2.74m)\nSolid Timber Floor\n\nKitchen - 8'2 (2.49m) x 18'1 (5.51m)\nLino Flooring and Fitted Kitchen\n\nOffice - 16'7 (5.05m) x 8'0 (2.44m)\nLino Flooring and plumbed\n\nBedroom 1 - 14'0 (4.27m) x 8'0 (2.44m)\nCarpet Flooring\n\nShower Room - 2'9 (0.84m) x 4'9 (1.45m)\nTiled floor to ceiling\n\nBathroom - 5'10 (1.78m) x 7'0 (2.13m)\nTiled floor to ceiling with w, whb and bath.\n\nBedroom 2 - 10'9 (3.28m) x 8'9 (2.67m)\nLaminate flooring and built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 3 - 8'11 (2.72m) x 9'4 (2.84m)\nLaminate flooring and built in wardrobe\n\nBedroom 4 - 12'0 (3.66m) x 14'7 (4.45m)\nLaminate flooring and built in wardrobes\n\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
